[i][b]Merry Christmas and Happy New Year![/b][/i]

2019 was an important year and taught us a lot. We are very grateful to these kind people who  help us to share the word.

[b]Key events and the totals of 2019:[/b]
[list]
[*] The demo release on Steam, Itch, GameJolt;
[*] Demo updates (2 times);
[*] 3200+ downloads;
[*] Fan arts and moral support;
[*] Many solved problems (organizational and technical);
[*] Constant work on the project and our skills.
[/list]

In general, we are pleased with the results of the year although much remains to be done. With your active support our inspiration will last for a long time! Thank you for staying with us and following the development of GP!

And don’t forget to add Guilty Parade to your Wishlist!

[b][i]See you in 2020![/i][/b]
